     <actual value="2">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CEDIG office acted as a safe space for the rightsholders to convene. Investing in the office space than setting up a new space increased efficiency and visibility in the work of CEDIG as an organisation. Additionally, it opened and ensured continued networking on Whatsapp forum among the rightsholders to share successes, challenges and offer support to each other. This enabled CEDIG to have a place to work from and also the rightsholders to have a place to come to when they needed the team support. This initiative developed through hospital and home visits, peer group and rightsholder trainings.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
